  "title": "Tax practice review memorandum",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Tax practice review memorandum</h2><p>Evaluate a preparer’s response to four engagement issues.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"reg-m1-tbs1-f1\">Response to the unsupported deduction</label><select id=\"reg-m1-tbs1-f1\"><option value=\"Investigate and obtain appropriate support\">Investigate and obtain appropriate support</option><option value=\"Use it despite known contradictions\">Use it despite known contradictions</option><option value=\"Increase it\">Increase it</option><option value=\"Treat the organizer as conclusive\">Treat the organizer as conclusive</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"reg-m1-tbs1-f2\">Treatment of low audit probability</label><select id=\"reg-m1-tbs1-f2\"><option value=\"It does not establish legal support\">It does not establish legal support</option><option value=\"It is the highest tax authority\">It is the highest tax authority</option><option value=\"It cures a frivolous position\">It cures a frivolous position</option><option value=\"It replaces professional diligence\">It replaces professional diligence</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"reg-m1-tbs1-f3\">Response to the prior omission</label><select id=\"reg-m1-tbs1-f3\"><option value=\"Advise the client of the error and consequences\">Advise the client of the error and consequences</option><option value=\"Repeat it silently\">Repeat it silently</option><option value=\"Destroy prior records\">Destroy prior records</option><option value=\"Publish the client’s identity\">Publish the client’s identity</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"reg-m1-tbs1-f4\">Response to the unfamiliar restructuring</label><select id=\"reg-m1-tbs1-f4\"><option value=\"Obtain competence or qualified assistance\">Obtain competence or qualified assistance</option><option value=\"Guess the tax result\">Guess the tax result</option><option value=\"Avoid all documentation\">Avoid all documentation</option><option value=\"Assume no tax applies\">Assume no tax applies</option></select></div></section>",
