    {
      "id": "reg-m1-tbs1-ex1",
      "title": "Client file",
      "html": "<p>A deduction lacks support and contradicts bank records. A partner wants to rely on the return’s low audit risk. A prior-year income omission is discovered. A complex restructuring exceeds the team’s expertise.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "reg-m1-tbs1-ex2",
      "title": "Required approach",
      "html": "<p>Apply diligence, authoritative research, client communication, and competence. Do not assume a disclosure or engagement letter eliminates substantive obligations.</p>"
    }
